{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">鍾景輝離世｜</span>一代戲劇巨匠鍾景輝（King Sir）於上月3日安詳離世，享年89歲。為紀念這位對香港演藝界有著畢生貢獻的大師，其家屬昨日（15日）於香港演藝學院舉行追思會。儀式雖不對外開放，但家屬透過全程公開直播，讓全港市民亦能一同悼念這位一代演藝宗師。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">King Sir一生桃李滿門，昨日多位昔日愛徒現身演藝學院致意，場面感人。出席人士包括張繼聰、蘇玉華、潘燦良、張達明、劉雅麗、張錦程、楊詩敏（蝦頭）等。其中，身型消瘦的張達明坐輪椅到場，向恩師作最後致敬。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5b73c266-0448-4f0c-a4ba-24fea6a738a9.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/202672FnKZ4tXC1784197284.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5b73c266-0448-4f0c-a4ba-24fea6a738a9.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">張繼聰表示，King Sir是他演藝路上的指路明燈，直言：「如果沒有King Sir讓我就讀，我就不會有整個演藝生涯。」他續指，後來有緣與恩師合作拍劇，有了更多傾談的機會，King Sir在他心中永遠是後輩學習的最高標準。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"991cff5a-8694-455d-b4be-256e2a9430b6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wRfThc8jJ51784197275.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"991cff5a-8694-455d-b4be-256e2a9430b6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">蘇玉華與潘燦良則難掩萬分不捨。他們認為，King Sir的離世不僅是學生的損失，更是香港人的損失，因他是一位極具分量的前輩。蘇玉華深信King Sir的精神將會永存：「King Sir好似在每個學生心中放了一粒種子，而這些種子會不斷成長、發芽、開花結果，這也是King Sir留給我們最珍貴的禮物。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">曾與King Sir在舞台劇及劇集中有合作的林保怡和曹永廉亦有到場。曹永廉憶述，2006年與King Sir合作處境劇《高朋滿座》的往事最令他難忘，大讚對方是謙謙君子，從不干涉旁人發揮，卻總樂意解惑。曹永廉分享當時曾問過King Sir：「我做得好唔好？」King Sir的袋錢落袋之言令他受用至今，「你把口係OK，但如果可以將對白由腦拉到落心講，就更加好。」這番話讓他參透多時，明白演戲與做人都要用心對待。至於姜大衞與樊亦敏雖然未曾與King Sir正式合作，但也專程到場，向這位令人仰慕的前輩致敬。</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T10:36:15.348896+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":763,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}